# Validation 02: RAW dependency chain.
# Two independent LOADs populate R5 and R6, then two ADDs
# chain their results. ADD R1 consumes R5 (independent
# of the chain), ADD R2 consumes R1 (RAW on the first
# ADD), and ADD R3 consumes R2 (RAW on the second).
# A Tomasulo pipeline still completes the chain in one
# dispatch per cycle, but no ADD can start until its
# source is ready.
LOAD R5, 100(R0)
LOAD R6, 104(R0)
ADD R1, R5, R0
ADD R2, R1, R1
ADD R3, R2, R0
h
